cted an episode of  Felicia day's new show called written by  a kid where is  is literally that she wrangled up a  bunch of children that came in and told  stories and then each episode is a child  story with a different director and our  job is to make that story come to life  and you can pick however you you can do  it like animation or you can do it you  know stop motion and I chose to do it  live action with puppets and what's  going to happen with the white room next  because this is actually the first film  festival that you shown it at isn't it  and it and you had a little bit of a  nightmare didn't you getting it here  yeah I mean that's the thing with I mean  I guess probably even like Joss Whedon  would tell you that this weekend with  the Avengers like probably three days  ago they were you know trying to cut in  the final effects and that's they had  hundreds of millions of dollars with  low-budget you know it's no different  it's even worse we I actually got to  London before the final film did so you  know my team burned the blu-ray and  fedexed it to me so when I was sitting  in the audience watching it on the big  screen that was the first time I saw the  finished product along likely you guys  so it's a little nerve-wracking that I  have some notes or something the auto  driver change but I guess that's just  part of the game you know when you don't  don't have like you know every resource  available from a studio you just have to  roll with it and keep smiling so is it  plan now more short films or maybe  feature films even yeah I i did this  particular short because i want to work  with Roddenberry and they wanted to  experiment with the technology but I'm  more into you know features and  television so I have a couple features  planned it's this year's going so fast  so hopefully we'll get one more in this  year and in a couple next year we also  are posting one from last year called  rock jocks which I wish it was done  because it would be perfect for for this  festival it's a sci-fi comedy it's a  almost done within the next couple weeks  which probably means that it'll be out  on the market and we'll make it not  eligible for next year because people  have already seen it but but it's funny  so yeah hopefully I'll have an  they're sci-fi feature and we can come  and spend more time more than 15 minutes  that's been testing well good luck with  that when it comes out and good luck for  the next feature that hopefully will be  coming here to slide by London I hope so  I love being here  you
 

